What follows is an intense battle of back-and-forth hits and victories. For his age, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> is actually pretty good, and you’d guess he has a lot of practice in this game. On the other hand, you’re no slouch either and the entire battle things feel nearly even. As it gets down to the final wire, both of you are sitting up, intensely focused. It will only take a single mistake for the victory to be decided! <br>
